  "prefLabel": "Plc 1302.10 Designated email address",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1302.10 “Designated email address” means an email address provided by an applicant or licensee as the address for the OPLC to use when sending notifications and licenses.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1300) #13701, eff 8-1-23",
